{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42636","headline":"塞上 一 · 谭用之","name":"塞上 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风汉北雁飞天，单骑那堪遶贺兰。\n碛暗更无岩树影，地平时有野烧瘢。\n貂披寒色和衣冷，劒佩胡霜隔匣寒。\n早晚横戈似飞尉，拥旄深入异田单。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谭用之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}